Z||000000||FieroKyle||11-11-2001||09:34 PM||||Alright, I just put on a new exhaust on the Buick Saturday, and I go pick up a friend to go cruising. There they were. They turned around and chased after us. I pull into a private drive to see if they were gonna come. Sure enough. I roll down the window to see whats the problem. And the ****er shot paintballs into my car. Got paint all over. I roll my windows up. They go into a driveway to turn around and I block them in, hitting and pushing them with the car. (They had a dodge reliant 4-door). Then I follow them for a while and turn off. My friend is like, well this time its just to far. So uh I now keep a 4 dozen eggs in my car and we are gonna go look for them this weekend. We are gonna get em back. We are all gonna get our paintball guns and just waste em. I will reply later this week to tell ya how things turn out and the causalties. Let the war begin.......<P>I am glad all my friends are seniors. Lol  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>------------------<BR>    <IMG SRC="http://communities.msn.com/_Secure/0PgAgVMwT!1W9RUb20vChbvv6QaE!2K1LWrFB6SxTnTchZgvIygv7Y3YwXpVdD8GeNkWpurYfoQxvNRK6j6kEmOFLoIHavbIr/Kyle-85-GT.jpg">    <P>My Fast 'n Black Car<BR>Kyle - 85' GT||||reg||8
