Z||000003||avengador1||11-11-2001||09:43 PM||||Don't turn this into a war. It's not worth it. Report them to the police. What they did would be considered assault with a deadly weapon in my state or at least illegal discharging of a firearm. Let the police know who they are and show them what they did. You should nick this in the bud before they graduate to real guns and bullets. The police should at least confiscate their paint guns and maybe bring them up on charges. What they did was illegal and dangerous not to mention very stupid.<P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Avendgador1.jpg"> ||||reg||1
Z||000004||FieroKyle||11-11-2001||09:51 PM||||Well, its an unwritten rule to not to get a thrid party involved. <BR>Number 2, they wanted mess with me, not just one occassion, but now twice. They will get their war.<BR>I couldn't wait till this hit school. I don't really think I could keep my head up in school if I ran to the police.<BR>Number 4, I can only hope this is just as far as it goes and not destruction of property, a paintball washes off, however a sledge hammer in the fender doesn't.<BR>Number 5, they didn't have guns, they had sling shots, whicgh though is just as bad.<BR>A Paint ball gun is not a fire arm, neither is a beebee gun. They are under a much lower class of weapons.||||reg||1
