Z||000007||Nashco||11-11-2001||10:47 PM||||Eggs in the car?  Have you learned nothing young grasshopper???<P>I would never call the cops either, they won't do jack, and you'll end up getting more crap for that.<P>If you want to get even, find out where this guy lives.  Then use such things as your eggs, some fish leftovers, and maybe some ford limited slip rear end additive just for kicks if you feel like being really nasty.  Take the said items, find a dark hour between 2am and 5am that suits you best, and insert said items in miscellaneous nooks and crannys of car.  In front of the radiator, on top of the muffler, and wedged between the inner fender and the body are my particular favorites.  Continue with a little bearing grease under the door handles, on the wiper blades, and on the bottom of the catalytic converter.  Makes for a big stinky, smelly, messy car.  Most of this isn't too harmful, but very aggrevating.  There, you have revenge.  Just make sure you don't get caught, and don't tell a soul!  Deny everything I say!  Deny it all!<P>Now, if you want to go further, I have plenty of ideas...but I try to avoid any possible lawsuits <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif">  I also don't like the whole world knowing what has been done, because that can be used against you if things get serious.<P>Just a warning, if you do anything in retaliation, make damn sure you keep your car closely guarded.  That, obviously, will be the first target they choose for retaliation.  Also, make sure your car is a little faster, and always full of gas <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>Be safe, god speed.<P>Bryce<BR>88 GT<BR>||||reg||1
