Z||000035||Formula88||11-12-2001||11:34 PM||||This is so High School people.  You want a war - give him a war.  And when he trashes your Fiero, be glad that you can throw eggs as a response.  <P>Don't be an idiot.  If you intend revenge, then you'd better make sure he CAN'T respond - because he will.  Either with another attack, or with the cops.  Because after your big attack, he can have you arrested, and you can whine all you like about "he did it first" and no one will care.<P>If you don't intend to KILL this person, either get over it or let the Police handle it.  Or you could go old school and just break his nose in front of all his friends.  Saying something about if he has a problem with you to be a man enough to face you.  You'll get busted for it and it may still escalate.  Your choice.  But sneaking around messing with his car/stuff, etc. is chicken sh!t.  <p>[This message has been edited by Formula88 (edited 11-12-2001).]||||reg||1
