Z||000042||Sootah||11-13-2001||09:04 PM||||Tear gas in the defroster vents, not much will be needed and he won't be able to drive his car for like 3-14 days. Non permanent but a huge pain in the ass. Actually he CAN drive it, but he'd have to hang his head out of the window...  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>Not that I've actually DONE that..  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smiley_damon.gif"><P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Sootah__Nuclear_Happy_Face_Sig.jpg">       <BR><sup><A HREF="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Sootah__Black_Beauty_-_Front_Right.jpg" TARGET=_blank>85 GT</A> - <A HREF="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Sootah__Busted-Ass_SE.jpg" TARGET=_blank>86 SE</A> (Parts car)<BR><I>Never pull your pants down in Cosco, the dang monkeys will getcha</I></sup> <BR><sup><B>AIM</B>: KSSouter</sup>||||reg||1
Z||000043||Mach10||11-13-2001||11:12 PM||||First things first... I won't take ANY responsibility with what you do. I'm actually quoting some books, which I will annotate at the end...<P>If you DO want to take revenge, do it RIGHT.<BR>Here are the ground-rules:<P>1) BE PATIENT. If you want to exact righteous revenge, you need to space the incident with the retribution. Basically, the idea is to let everyone get over it, then hit HARD.<P>2) BE DISCREET. Tell no-one... That way, you can't get squealed on. Don't BRAG, and only include the BARE minimum of people required to help<P>3) BE ABSTRACT. If he hit your car, consider not going after his... Again, distance the action from your previous run-ins. Less chance of being caught<P>4) PLAN AHEAD. Make sure that the plan is FLAWLESS. Redundancy is your friend. Know what to do in ANY situation that could arise... <P>5) DON'T HURT ANYONE. Destruction of property is one thing... Bodily harm is another. <P>Ok, here's some hints:<P>Car: <BR>-Go to your hardware store, and grab a couple of bottles of 2-part epoxy. Fill the crank-case with 'em. He'll start the car, which will mix the resin, which will promptly start to set. NOT pretty.<BR>-Expando-foam works even better in the interior. But if access is a problem, try a couple of cans in the engine compartment<BR>-Toss a couple of whole egg-yolks into the gas tank. This will clog the pump, but back out after sitting for a while. The mark's mechanic will have a ball finding THIS one out.<BR>-Roadkill in strategic locations in the interior. Let the bugger figure out where the smell came from<BR>-Draining tranny fluid is good for a larff<BR>-Ditto coolant<BR>-For longer-term, but NASTIER effects, a couple of heaping table-spoons of Jeweler's Rouge in the crankcase will work MARVELS in about 6K<BR>-Get some carbide sand-paper, and "fog" up his windows... Permanently<BR>-Take off his wiper blades. Apply a line of superglue on the edge. Coat glue in fine sand. Watch his windows get scratched up.<BR>-Sneak up underneath car (RWD only) and pry off balancing weighs on drive-shaft. Ditto the tires. Even better, RELOCATE them about 30* in either direction<BR>-Switch plug-wires... just 2 will do it.<BR>-Mothballs in the gas-tank tend to hurt.<BR>-With a hose and funnel, fill his muffler with tranny fluid. When his car warms up, watch the smoke  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><BR>-chain the rear axle (or any sturdy frame member) to a tree. Or to a cop-car.   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><BR>-Chain a couple of wheels together. <BR>Tie the end of a roll of 50lb-test fishing line to one of the accessory pulleys. Ever seen what happens to a lawn-mover that goes over fishing tackle? <BR>-Prick pin-holes into major hoses. No leaks when cold, steam-bath when warm.<BR>-Pour a couple of cups of salt into the rad. (sidewalk salt, or table-salt works FINE) Watch it eat holes in his cooling system<BR>-Wonder what would happen if someone were to pour a couple of cups of nitric acid into the oil pan? <BR>-Water in an automatic tranny will reduce it to iron filings SUPER fast. I know this one from experience.<BR>-Pour a handful of BB shot into the intake plennum/manifold.<BR>-one simple bumpersticker "KILL ALL COPS" and "WHITE POWER" will ensure that the mark can't even MOVE withot being cited for something. Poor bastard won't even know what hit him<P>All right, enough of the cars: HEre's the PEOPLE. Psychological warfare at it's best:<P>-save some money, and subscribe the mark to a bunch of the more controversial magazines. Homo-sexuality is accepted, more-or-less, so that's no good. But Bestiality still isn't  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"> Another good topic is Pedophilia. Find some, order it for him/her, and turn him/her in.<BR>-Singles ads are a great way to meet interesting people... Aren't they?  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smiley_damon.gif"><BR>-Hire a hooker to break up his/her relationship. Watch him try to squirm his way out of a confrontation... Be sure to fill the hooker in on all sorts of details.. Makes it much harder to dodge  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><BR>-Can you say, "File 2 IRS forms?" the ensuing chaos and audits will do the rest.<BR>-Organize a party with some of the more hardcore members of your local youth gangs/bikers and set the marks house as the location. Arrange for live music.<BR>-Hide a frozen squid in his air-ducts... Lemme tell you. There is NOTHING like the stench of rotting Cephalopod.<BR>-Go to pet store. Order 1000 feeder crickets. Throw into air ducts. Toss head of lettuce after them. Enjoy!<BR>-Start heaving road-kill into the back yard. about 15 critters will do it  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> 50pt bonus for dead skunks<BR>-If you are in the colder climes, build a mould around his car with 2x4s... Then flood it. Skating rink! And his tires frozen into 3-4" of solid ice<BR>-Just ice his driveway<P><BR>I've got plenty more, but this post is getting MIGHTY long!<P>-<BR>||||reg||10
Z||000044||Pheagey||11-13-2001||11:51 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Pontiaddict:<BR><B> I can think of about 7 ways <I>that</I> can backfire.</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>7? thats it?...<P>Really thougth what a guy to do?<BR>a)tell the 'authorities'? <BR>   yea, like they're ganna do anything...<BR>b)sneak around and mess w/ his sh_t?<BR>   na, to miuch like you have something to hide.<BR>c)f_ck his GF?<BR>   I think we all agree <I>thats</I> a BAD idea.<BR>d) walk up[ to him and out of the blue bust his face up.<BR>   Sounds likes a plan! If the school kicks you out you have the days wot work on the fiero right? (Or kiss ur parents ass to get un grounded so you CAN work on it.) And to top it off everyone will know not to mess w/ you 'cause your a mean a$$ motherf_cker who don't take sh_t from no-one...<P>then again yopu could ignore it andf piss mine off more...<P>Its a loss loss situation...<P>------------------<BR>'88 coupe, 5 speed.<BR>"The car formerly know as Dj's Fiero."||||reg||1
